> expand (x+1)/3
  ucas: expand (x+1)/3
expand (x + 1)/3
  = x/3 + 1/3
  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)
> expand (2*x+1)/3
  ucas: expand (2*x+1)/3
expand (2x + 1)/3
  = 2x/3 + 1/3
  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)
> cancel (3*x+1)/(6*x+2)
cancel (3x + 1)/(6x + 2)
  = 1/2
  holds where 3x + 1 != 0 (cancelled there)
  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)
> factor (2*x+2)/4
  ucas: factor (2*x+2)/4
factor (2x + 2)/4
  = (x + 1)/2
  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)
> simplify (x^2-1)/(x-1)
  ucas: simplify (x^2-1)/(x-1)
simplify (x^2 - 1)/(x - 1)
  = x + 1
  holds where x - 1 != 0 (cancelled there)
  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)
> expand 0.1*x + 0.2
  ucas: expand 0.1*x + 0.2
expand 0.1x + 0.2
  = x/10 + 1/5
  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)
> simplify 1/3*x + 2/3
  ucas: simplify 1/3*x + 2/3
simplify 0.3333333333x + 0.6666666667
  = (x + 2)/3
